# BeatStars

> BeatStars is an online marketplace for buying and selling beats
> (instrumental music), connecting music producers with artists since 2008.
> Producers upload beats and sell licenses; artists browse, preview, and
> license beats for songs, videos, and commercial projects.

## Key facts

- Founded: 2008, by Abe Batshon. Headquarters: Austin, Texas, USA.
- Community: over 10 million creators worldwide.
- Payouts: over $400 million paid out to producers to date.
- Notable: beats licensed on BeatStars have been used on charting records,
  including Lil Nas X's "Old Town Road".

## How licensing works

Artists license beats rather than buying them outright in most cases. Standard
tiers: MP3 lease, WAV lease, trackout/stems lease, and exclusive rights. Each
producer sets prices and terms per beat. Licenses grant defined usage rights
(streams, videos, performances) spelled out per license.

